Changelog: Field HUD Pro


​[1.6] - 2026-10-15
​RTK Guides: Added platform-specific connection instructions for Android and iOS users.
​Project Workflow: Replaced native dropdowns with streamlined card options to switch, rename, or create projects.
​UI Cleanup: Added quick-dismiss buttons to clear stakeout panels and visual radar clutter.

​[1.5] - 2026-10-14
​Layout Optimization: Moved stakeout navigation below the title bar to prevent button clipping.
​Field Manual: Overhauled the HLP modal with clear explanations of toolbar and mapping features.

​[1.2 to 1.4] - 2026-10-12
​Coordinate Engine: Added automatic global GPS detection for State Plane and UTM zones.
​COGO Tools: Enabled direct map-point selection for inverse calculations.

​[1.0] - 2026-10-10
​Initial Release: Deployed offline-capable PWA on GitHub Pages with mapping and CSV/DXF exports.
